From 2e9cdb06ccb4cfa4bbfc016493440264da5f3dc5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:31:08 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(import): a STEP re-import keeps the model's recorded
 facet budget

Without an explicit budget (GUI session setting never committed, or an
MCP/script import without facet_budget) a STEP import onto an existing
model now runs under the budget recorded with it, so a restart no longer
re-meshes it at the default. An explicit budget wins and is recorded.

Fixes #1185

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
